+// FBB (b1741, Combat spec_fbb_1109 with the Rule Checker's notes): fight-entry rules check the burst in reach. B = the foes' summed
+// next-turn burst on a tile (lethal_burst_damage_sum at LB_CDH); for the prism guard and peel the larger of my tile and my first step
